        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fl_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Like a project manager who breaks a job into child jobs, waits for each, then checks the whole plan.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Create a local proposal, validate, recurse per child, aggregate, then run global validation. Cites live in the Impl map; e.g. &lt;code&gt;task_execution.py:477&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Recursion is a nested run of the same workflow at depth +1, not a tangled return arrow to Start." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#F7F7F2;strokeColor=#6B6B6B;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="480" y="840" width="460" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
